 972:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c **** /** @defgroup I2C_Exported_Functions_Group2 Input and Output operation functions
 973:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****  *  @brief   Data transfers functions
 974:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****  *
 975:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c **** @verbatim
 976:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****  ===============================================================================
 977:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****                       ##### IO operation functions #####
 978:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****  ===============================================================================
 979:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     [..]
 980:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     This subsection provides a set of functions allowing to manage the I2C data
 981:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     transfers.
 982:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
 983:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     (#) There are two modes of transfer:
 984:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (++) Blocking mode : The communication is performed in the polling mode.
 985:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             The status of all data processing is returned by the same function
 986:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             after finishing transfer.
 987:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****        (++) No-Blocking mode : The communication is performed using Interrupts
 988:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             or DMA. These functions return the status of the transfer startup.
 989:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             The end of the data processing will be indicated through the
 990:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             dedicated I2C IRQ when using Interrupt mode or the DMA IRQ when
 991:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****             using DMA mode.
 992:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
 993:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     (#) Blocking mode functions are :
 994:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (++) HAL_I2C_Master_Transmit()
 995:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (++) HAL_I2C_Master_Receive()
 996:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (++) HAL_I2C_Slave_Transmit()
 997:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (++) HAL_I2C_Slave_Receive()
 998:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (++) HAL_I2C_Mem_Write()
 999:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (++) HAL_I2C_Mem_Read()
1000:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****         (++) HAL_I2C_IsDeviceReady()
1001:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c **** 
1002:Drivers/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2c.c ****     (#) No-Blocking mode functions with Interrupt are :
